## Required changes

- `shop-catalog-mysql`: `point-in-time-restore` (not offered by `Managed Database for PostgreSQL and MySQL`)
- `shop-db`: `point-in-time-restore`, `zone-high-availability` (not offered by `Managed Database for PostgreSQL and MySQL`)
- `shop-gke`: `zone-high-availability` (not offered by `Kubernetes Kapsule`)
- `shop-web-1-data`: `encryption-at-rest` (not offered by `Block Storage`)
- `shop-web-mig`: `autoscaling`, `zone-high-availability` (not offered by `Instances`)

